abstract: >-
  Protocol-only core of the indicium domain-adapter ecosystem.
  Defines DomainAdapter and SHACLProvider structural Protocols, the
  CompositeAdapter helper, and the discover_adapters() entry-point
  discovery function. Domain-specific bundles ship in sibling
  indicium-adapters-<domain> packages.
